      "content": "that makes a lot of sense. i think i'm going to try talking to the speaker tonight, just to see if i can get a response. if i try to say something to him and the lights respond or the speaker makes a sound, how would that actually work from a technical side? like, what would it look like if the system was actually reacting to his presence instead of just running a routine?",
